WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by fofiko1 and Rémi

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:10.502
Candy thought a passenger
on the train was a murderer.

00:00:10.652 --> 00:00:14.373
Actually, the passenger was the new doctor
for the construction site.

00:00:14.523 --> 00:00:18.077
It was a woman doctor.

00:00:20.087 --> 00:00:27.186
A clinic that doesn't need angels

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.099
All right.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:10.796
Thank you very much.

00:01:10.946 --> 00:01:13.098
Don't move him
before the anaesthetic goes away.

00:01:13.248 --> 00:01:14.504
Yes.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:20.005
Right, Candy,
don't tell anyone that I am a woman.

00:01:20.155 --> 00:01:22.310
Yes.

00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:26.184
They don't take women doctors here.

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:35.387
We lost another good fellow.

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:40.222
He will never be healed.

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:43.895
Let's drink all night.

00:01:44.045 --> 00:01:46.864
Cheers!

00:01:47.014 --> 00:01:48.634
Please keep quiet.

00:01:48.784 --> 00:01:52.304
Miss, are you going
to stay here and work?

00:01:52.454 --> 00:01:55.474
Please drink somewhere else.

00:01:55.624 --> 00:01:57.643
This is the clinic!

00:01:57.793 --> 00:02:02.746
Miss, we are remembering
the soul of a deceased person.

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:07.257
A deceased person?
Did anyone die?

00:02:09.763 --> 00:02:12.596
Who was it?

00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:16.091
Ben, the person
who was injured this afternoon.

00:02:16.211 --> 00:02:18.437
But Ben is still alive!

00:02:18.647 --> 00:02:21.166
Really?

00:02:21.316 --> 00:02:24.503
Dr. Kerry just finished the operation.

00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:26.571
Yes.

00:02:26.721 --> 00:02:29.772
Is this a good idea?

00:02:29.992 --> 00:02:37.319
Before today...
All the injured people died.

00:02:38.692 --> 00:02:42.821
Guys, the doctor, this time,
is not an idiot.

00:02:42.971 --> 00:02:46.024
And the nurse is good too.

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:52.671
Quiet! There is a patient inside!

00:02:53.181 --> 00:02:55.939
What do you want?

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:08.980
How can you be naked before a lady!

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.082
Wait!

00:03:10.232 --> 00:03:11.249
Let go of me!

00:03:11.399 --> 00:03:15.351
Give this back to Ben for me.

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:18.457
This is...

00:03:18.607 --> 00:03:19.357
How can I say it?

00:03:19.507 --> 00:03:23.829
We made a mistake.
We thought he was going to die, so...

00:03:23.979 --> 00:03:25.629
That...

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:28.467
These people are so mean.

00:03:28.617 --> 00:03:30.703
And they act fast.

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:37.312
I am hungry, too.

00:03:38.201 --> 00:03:39.575
Come in.

00:03:43.557 --> 00:03:48.987
Master Doctor, nice to meet you.
My name is Margot.

00:03:49.137 --> 00:03:50.927
I am Kerry.

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:55.226
I hope Master Doctor likes it.

00:03:55.376 --> 00:03:56.628
It seems delicious.

00:03:56.778 --> 00:04:00.181
The nurse's dinner
is in another room.

00:04:00.481 --> 00:04:02.791
Sorry, please bring her food here.

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.203
It's not appropriate.

00:04:05.353 --> 00:04:08.441
It tastes better with company.

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:13.978
Belle, bring the nurse's dinner here!

00:04:14.128 --> 00:04:15.645
Yes.

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:19.422
Thank you.

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:24.656
That's quite different.

00:04:24.806 --> 00:04:27.859
Enjoy your meal.

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:34.265
Wait, Margot.

00:04:34.415 --> 00:04:38.603
From tomorrow,
Candy will have the same food as me.

00:04:38.753 --> 00:04:40.205
No, I...

00:04:40.355 --> 00:04:43.007
But, the doctor before...

00:04:43.157 --> 00:04:46.176
I have my way.

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:48.943
Yes.

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:52.183
And just call me Doctor.

00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:55.227
Yes, Master Doctor.

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:01.859
Let's eat.

00:05:02.009 --> 00:05:03.333
Ok.

00:05:06.238 --> 00:05:07.603
Here.

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.301
I am ok.

00:05:10.451 --> 00:05:14.572
That's ok. Aren't you hungry?

00:05:14.722 --> 00:05:16.342
I am sorry.

00:05:19.418 --> 00:05:25.721
Candy, this is not a big hospital.
There is only the two of us.

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:29.856
We are both doctor and nurse.

00:05:30.896 --> 00:05:39.397
Sometimes, I will be the nurse
and you, Candy, will be the doctor.

00:05:39.547 --> 00:05:40.864
OK.

00:05:41.014 --> 00:05:42.474
I will work hard.

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:49.407
What? The same food
for the nurse and the doctor?

00:05:49.557 --> 00:05:50.942
Yes.

00:05:51.092 --> 00:05:53.311
That nurse is being too much.

00:05:53.761 --> 00:05:56.647
No, it was the doctor
who asked for it.

00:05:57.256 --> 00:06:00.623
That doctor came to play, too.

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:04.522
What should we do?

00:06:04.772 --> 00:06:09.266
Do what they said.
They won't stay long.

00:06:12.471 --> 00:06:16.737
You challenged me from the beginning,
you little freckled nurse!

00:06:20.746 --> 00:06:23.107
Candy, I can do it myself.

00:06:23.257 --> 00:06:26.345
But you just finished an operation.

00:06:26.685 --> 00:06:28.812
Candy, didn't you too?

00:06:29.021 --> 00:06:33.050
I am fine.
Let me hang your coat for you.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.025
I'll do it.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:47.132
The poster with the reward.

00:06:49.074 --> 00:06:52.102
Are you suspicious of my identity?

00:06:52.252 --> 00:06:53.701
Yes.

00:06:55.347 --> 00:06:57.174
He looks like me, right?

00:06:57.324 --> 00:06:59.308
Yes.

00:07:00.352 --> 00:07:02.179
Look closely at the name on it.

00:07:02.329 --> 00:07:07.551
Arthur Kerry, 20 years old.
Kerry?

00:07:07.701 --> 00:07:09.553
That's my brother.

00:07:09.703 --> 00:07:11.616
He's your brother?

00:07:11.766 --> 00:07:15.158
He has a gentle soul
and would never kill anyone.

00:07:15.308 --> 00:07:17.497
But, why is he wanted?

00:07:17.736 --> 00:07:23.033
He likes animals. He worked part-time
and studied to be a vet.

00:07:23.708 --> 00:07:26.506
One day, he went to work...

00:07:30.231 --> 00:07:32.926
Arthur, your pay.

00:07:33.076 --> 00:07:35.529
But, it's not payday yet.

00:07:35.679 --> 00:07:37.864
This is your last day.

00:07:38.164 --> 00:07:40.984
That's not what we agreed!

00:07:41.134 --> 00:07:43.286
You are fired.

00:07:43.736 --> 00:07:45.261
All right.

00:07:47.131 --> 00:07:48.962
Where are you doing?

00:07:49.333 --> 00:07:54.498
I am going to the boss.
You lied to me and made me work here.

00:07:54.872 --> 00:07:59.268
Damn! Are you threatening me?

00:07:59.418 --> 00:08:03.507
You cheated me.
Do you want to fire me?

00:08:04.482 --> 00:08:05.972
Wait.

00:08:07.285 --> 00:08:10.846
I won't allow you to go to the boss.

00:08:26.771 --> 00:08:28.136
Do you want to fight?

00:08:44.388 --> 00:08:46.185
He's dead!

00:08:46.657 --> 00:08:51.788
From that day,
my brother became a wanted criminal.

00:08:52.263 --> 00:08:55.591
So, you don't know where he is now?

00:08:56.141 --> 00:08:59.961
He would probably come
to this kind of place.

00:09:00.111 --> 00:09:03.035
So that's why
you came here to be a doctor?

00:09:05.443 --> 00:09:10.272
Yes. I hope to make him turn himself in.
Running away will make things worse.

00:09:10.422 --> 00:09:15.344
Doctor, I'll ask around for you.

00:09:15.494 --> 00:09:18.650
Maybe somebody
would know where he is.

00:09:40.778 --> 00:09:42.800
Thank you, Miss.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.415
You will get well soon.

00:09:49.353 --> 00:09:54.290
The last time I was fed by someone
was when I was a baby.

00:09:57.227 --> 00:10:04.760
Miss, it's an emergency!
Open the door!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:08.566
I am coming! Please be quiet!

00:10:08.906 --> 00:10:10.999
Please, Miss.

00:10:11.149 --> 00:10:13.969
Do you need emergency treatment?

00:10:14.119 --> 00:10:16.239
All of us.

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.307
All of you?

00:10:18.457 --> 00:10:22.341
Please, treat us!

00:10:40.887 --> 00:10:48.089
Wait.
Don't push, please line up!

00:10:48.528 --> 00:10:56.333
I am the first. Treat me.

00:10:59.239 --> 00:11:00.831
What's wrong?

00:11:02.008 --> 00:11:10.001
Stomach ache, ringing in the ears,
headache, and rash.

00:11:10.391 --> 00:11:11.910
- Me too, Doctor.
- Me too.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:19.084
Open your mouth.

00:11:20.193 --> 00:11:22.254
Nothing is wrong.

00:11:22.704 --> 00:11:26.925
Are you saying that
I am pretending to be sick?

00:11:27.075 --> 00:11:29.590
That's not what I meant.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:33.672
Doctor, don't you
trust your patients?

00:11:35.475 --> 00:11:36.908
But...

00:11:37.277 --> 00:11:41.139
Please keep quiet!
There is a patient inside.

00:11:41.489 --> 00:11:45.677
Miss, aren't we patients too?

00:11:45.827 --> 00:11:47.476
That's not what I meant!

00:11:47.626 --> 00:11:52.758
Dr. Kerry, please tell them the truth.

00:11:53.293 --> 00:11:57.155
Candy..
Candy...

00:11:57.305 --> 00:12:00.023
What do I have?

00:12:00.173 --> 00:12:05.230
The Doctor is afraid
that you won't be able to take it.

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:08.001
Is it that serious?

00:12:08.441 --> 00:12:13.538
It's acute brain tumor.

00:12:13.813 --> 00:12:15.073
Acute brain tumor?

00:12:15.223 --> 00:12:19.177
To put it simply,
there is a bug in your brain.

00:12:19.327 --> 00:12:21.479
A bug in my brain?

00:12:21.629 --> 00:12:29.086
But, you don't need to worry.
We just need to open your head.

00:12:31.498 --> 00:12:34.659
You are going to open my head?

00:12:34.809 --> 00:12:39.864
The doctor has other patients
to take care of, I'll do the operation.

00:12:40.314 --> 00:12:46.644
Are you kidding me?

00:12:47.513 --> 00:12:49.640
Is Mr. Mario next?

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:55.676
No, I feel OK now.
How could it be possible?

00:12:56.322 --> 00:12:58.580
Which idiot is in my way?

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:01.784
How come you are not working?

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.091
Don't fool them.

00:13:07.241 --> 00:13:10.828
No. Candy is trying to help me.

00:13:10.978 --> 00:13:14.339
Doctor, you are in favour of the nurse.

00:13:19.812 --> 00:13:23.373
Who does he think he is?

00:13:24.483 --> 00:13:26.644
Tiandy!

00:13:28.454 --> 00:13:30.285
Belle!

00:13:32.425 --> 00:13:33.951
Tiandy!

00:13:34.101 --> 00:13:36.721
Good morning,
you are Belle, right?

00:13:36.871 --> 00:13:39.257
Breakfast is ready, Tiandy.

00:13:39.407 --> 00:13:43.227
Thank you. My name is Candy.

00:13:43.377 --> 00:13:44.997
Tiandy.

00:13:45.304 --> 00:13:46.964
Candy.

00:13:47.114 --> 00:13:48.399
Tiandy.

00:13:48.549 --> 00:13:50.999
Not Tiandy, but Candy.

00:13:51.344 --> 00:13:56.008
I am confused, too!

00:13:59.051 --> 00:14:01.111
Candy seems to be happy.

00:14:01.261 --> 00:14:02.346
That's good.

00:14:02.496 --> 00:14:04.014
I am relieved as long as Candy is okay.

00:14:04.164 --> 00:14:07.718
Dr. Kerry seems to be a good doctor

00:14:07.868 --> 00:14:09.653
Who is doctor Kerry?

00:14:09.803 --> 00:14:12.223
The new doctor at Candy's clinic.

00:14:12.373 --> 00:14:16.667
May I see it?

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:20.962
Kerry...
Could it be the Kerry I know?

00:14:24.343 --> 00:14:26.503
Do you know him?

00:14:26.653 --> 00:14:29.340
The Kerry I know
was a young student at school.

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:31.175
Her medical skill was superb.

00:14:31.625 --> 00:14:34.845
It didn't mention in the letter
if the doctor was a man or a woman.

00:14:34.995 --> 00:14:36.914
I thought it was a male doctor.

00:14:37.064 --> 00:14:41.018
If it was a female doctor,
it would have mentioned it.

00:14:41.168 --> 00:14:44.621
Where's the Kerry you know?

00:14:44.771 --> 00:14:49.429
I am not sure. Her brother
had an accident or something.

00:15:03.848 --> 00:15:06.810
Archie, write Candy back and find out.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.012
I think it's a man.

00:15:09.162 --> 00:15:12.420
Really? I think it's a woman.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:32.904
That guy has been following us.

00:15:34.979 --> 00:15:37.812
Annie, do you know him?

00:15:41.719 --> 00:15:44.051
Why are you following us?

00:15:46.524 --> 00:15:51.020
Excuse me, do you know Dr. Martin?

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:53.791
Not very close.

00:15:55.466 --> 00:15:59.896
Did he mention anything
about Dr. Kerry?

00:16:00.046 --> 00:16:02.838
He just did a while ago.

00:16:05.843 --> 00:16:08.438
Where is that person?

00:16:08.588 --> 00:16:11.274
Excuse me, who are you?

00:16:11.424 --> 00:16:19.218
- I...
- Are you Dr. Kerry's brother?

00:16:21.492 --> 00:16:23.285
Wait up!

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:34.628
Archie!

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.233
He's gone.

00:16:37.383 --> 00:16:38.701
Why did he run away?

00:16:38.851 --> 00:16:42.007
He thought
that we would call the police.

00:16:47.718 --> 00:16:50.346
After ten days,
the bandages can be removed.

00:16:50.496 --> 00:16:56.360
Thank you very much.
Doctor, you saved my life.

00:16:56.627 --> 00:17:01.590
Dr. Kerry, we received a letter.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:04.600
It's from my friend in Chicago.

00:17:07.104 --> 00:17:09.331
My brother is in Chicago.

00:17:09.481 --> 00:17:12.807
He must still be in Chicago.

00:17:13.811 --> 00:17:14.603
Candy.

00:17:14.753 --> 00:17:15.571
Yes.

00:17:15.721 --> 00:17:20.643
Ben's situation is under control now.
Can you take care of him for a week?

00:17:20.793 --> 00:17:22.878
Are you going to Chicago?

00:17:23.028 --> 00:17:27.817
I am in a hurry to find him.
I don't want to waste any time.

00:17:27.967 --> 00:17:31.120
Go ahead.
I'll take care of the clinic.

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:33.663
I will talk to Mr. Nelson.

00:17:34.498 --> 00:17:39.435
I hope there won't be
any emergency.

00:17:45.042 --> 00:17:48.037
Will it be OK if I leave for a week?

00:17:48.187 --> 00:17:52.274
As you wish.
There are no patients right now.

00:17:52.424 --> 00:17:53.676
Thank you.

00:17:53.826 --> 00:17:56.078
You must come back.

00:17:56.228 --> 00:17:57.847
I will come back.

00:17:57.997 --> 00:18:01.085
Doctors often run away.

00:18:13.036 --> 00:18:15.297
Please be careful.

00:18:15.447 --> 00:18:17.736
Thank you.

00:18:19.186 --> 00:18:22.408
Yes.

00:18:34.891 --> 00:18:37.086
Be careful!

00:18:57.180 --> 00:19:01.048
Emergency!

00:19:02.919 --> 00:19:04.446
Come quickly!

00:19:04.596 --> 00:19:06.250
Yes!

00:19:06.456 --> 00:19:09.755
The thing I was worried most about
finally happened.

00:19:12.829 --> 00:19:14.660
Hurry.

00:19:15.298 --> 00:19:16.925
In the tunnel.

00:19:29.312 --> 00:19:30.973
Go straight.

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:42.396
Why isn't anyone here?

00:19:48.932 --> 00:19:53.426
I am the nurse, Candy.

00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:59.401
Mr. Nelson...

00:19:59.751 --> 00:20:01.803
I am the patient.

00:20:01.953 --> 00:20:04.339
Would a patient drink?

00:20:04.889 --> 00:20:07.342
My disease is called
"I hate nurses".

00:20:07.692 --> 00:20:10.347
You lied to me
and made me come here?

00:20:10.586 --> 00:20:13.882
I should say
that I don't want you here.

00:20:14.032 --> 00:20:15.316
Why?

00:20:15.466 --> 00:20:18.915
After you came here,
the works have been seriously delayed.

00:20:19.465 --> 00:20:23.858
- What do you mean?
- For every hurt finger, twisted wrist,

00:20:24.008 --> 00:20:29.264
bruise or bang, everybody comes
to the clinic for treatment.

00:20:29.414 --> 00:20:31.499
Aren't those my responsibilities?

00:20:31.649 --> 00:20:36.471
I don't need a fussy nurse.

00:20:36.821 --> 00:20:38.439
I am just doing my job!

00:20:38.889 --> 00:20:43.344
If everyone goes to the clinic,
the project will be delayed!

00:20:43.494 --> 00:20:47.582
Mr. Nelson,
no matter how small a wound is,

00:20:47.732 --> 00:20:50.551
it could turn really bad.

00:20:50.701 --> 00:20:57.025
I don't need a lesson.
Are you leaving or not?

00:20:57.175 --> 00:20:58.393
I am not leaving.

00:20:58.543 --> 00:21:01.429
I have the responsibility to
take care of the clinic for Dr. Kerry.

00:21:01.579 --> 00:21:04.530
Well then...

00:21:06.542 --> 00:21:08.039
What do you want from me?

00:21:10.246 --> 00:21:14.110
You don't listen to me,
it's not my fault.

00:21:20.356 --> 00:21:24.258
There is no help in the tunnel.

00:21:24.427 --> 00:21:27.487
Candy is frozen by fear.
